le pair or a blocking bet. My two pair, while weak, beats all single pairs. Given the tiny size of the bet (300 chips) and favorable pot odds, folding would be a mistake. Raising would turn my hand into a bluff since better hands will call and worse hands will fold. Calling is the optimal play to realize my equity against what's likely a weaker hand.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
